# Jenkins Pipeline — Complete Setup Guide
### Installation → Configuration → Pipelines → Best Practices

---

## What is Jenkins?

**Jenkins** = Java-based open-source automation server. CI/CD ke liye use hota hai.

```
Developer → git push → Jenkins detects → Build → Test → Docker build
→ Push to ECR → Deploy to K8s → Notify team
```

**Jenkins ke 2 types ke pipelines:**
- **Freestyle Job** — GUI-based, click karke configure karo (old way, avoid karo)
- **Pipeline (Jenkinsfile)** — code mein likho, Git mein rakho (modern, recommended)

