### Multibranch Pipeline (recommended)

Automatically har branch par pipeline run karo bina manually job banaye.

```
Jenkins → New Item → Multibranch Pipeline

Branch Sources:
  Git → https://github.com/myorg/my-app.git
  Credentials: github-token

Build Configuration:
  Mode: by Jenkinsfile
  Script Path: Jenkinsfile   ← repo ke root mein hona chahiye

Scan Multibranch Pipeline Triggers:
  ✅ Periodically if not otherwise run: 1 minute
```

Ab:
- Har branch par Jenkinsfile dhundha jayega
- Nayi branch banao → automatically job create hogi
- Branch delete karo → job bhi delete hogi

