# PART 9 — Security Best Practices

---

```
✅ Credentials kabhi Jenkinsfile mein hardcode mat karo
✅ withCredentials block use karo secrets ke liye
✅ Jenkins master par builds mat chalao — agents use karo
✅ RBAC setup karo — har developer ko full admin access mat do
✅ Plugins regularly update karo
✅ Jenkins URL HTTPS par rakho (SSL certificate lagao)
✅ Build logs mein secrets print nahi hone chahiye
✅ Workspace cleanup karo post block mein
✅ Old builds regularly delete karo (logRotator)
```

### RBAC in Jenkins
```
Manage Jenkins → Security → Authorization
  → Role-Based Strategy (Role Strategy Plugin chahiye)

Roles:
  admin  → full access
  dev    → build trigger, view logs
  viewer → read-only
```

