## One-Line Summary — Interview Close karne ke liye

> *"Basically — code push se lekar browser tak ka flow hai:*
> ***GitHub → Jenkins → ECR → Helm → K8s Pods → Ingress → ALB → Route 53 → User.***
> *Har step automated hai except production approval jo intentionally manual hai — taaki koi accidental deploy na ho."*

